  "title": "Mexican Quesadilla Casserole",
  "description": "This easy, yummy one-pan Mexican-style quesadilla casserole recipe layers beef, soft tortillas, black beans, veggies, bold spices, and melted cheese.",
  "authors": [
    "Melissa mieske"
  ],
  "date_published": "2011-10-27T03:21:22-04:00",
